eceived word that Mihoshi is unhappy on Earth, and send their state-of-the-art battleship out to collect her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ejmjVvk73v8pir9K59n8ygksnL.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"A combination of stress and exhaustion leaves Tenchi bedridden, and Tenchi's fiancée Noike nurses him back to health. Once he recovers, Noike shows Tenchi a new experimental Juraian ship designed to be more effective against any attacking foe. Meanwhile, the Kuramitsu family have received word that Mihoshi is unhappy on Earth, and send their state-of-the-art battleship out to collect her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ejmjVvk73v8pir9K59n8ygksnL.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2510","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"541","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"541","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"43004","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80009","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"67714","synopsis":"Mihoshi's brother Misao develops the notion that his beloved sister is part of a harem run by Tenchi and swears to kill him. However, his adjutant, Mashisu, has other plans for the mission. Meanwhile, the princesses' grandmother, Lady Seto, arrives for a visit, and the family prepare a special meal to welcome her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dYpB3pUeBXZdC8xoQjCSWLyXyMq.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Mihoshi's brother Misao develops the notion that his beloved sister is part of a harem run by Tenchi and swears to kill him. However, his adjutant, Mashisu, has other plans for the mission. Meanwhile, the princesses' grandmother, Lady Seto, arrives for a visit, and the family prepare a speci